==In animation==
===''[[Pokémon the Series: Sun and Moon]]''===
[[File:Madame SM.png|250px|thumb|The recurring Madame in ''[[Pokémon the Series: Sun & Moon]]'']]
In ''[[SM007|That's Why the Litten is a Scamp!]]'', a Madame greeted her {{rf|Alolan}} {{p|Persian}}, [[nickname]]d Pershie, when it returned to her after taking {{AP|Litten}}'s food. In ''[[SM083|Dummy, You Shrunk the Kids!]]'', the Madame was chatting with a friend, unaware that Pershie had been chasing after a shrunken {{Ash}} and {{an|Lillie}}. She was later shocked when Pershie returned after being defeated by [[Mallow's Tsareena]]. In ''[[SM099|We Know Where You're Going, Eevee!]]'', she tried on jewelry and didn't realize when Pershie went to chase after an [[Sandy|Eevee]]. She later found Pershie when Eevee and {{TP|Lana|Popplio}} had given it the slip.

